---
<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  keywords="Sportivo, sportivo, NPL live match, npl live match, npl live streaming, watch npl live, Nepal Premier League 2026, NPL schedule, live sports fixtures, Nepal Standard Time kickoff, football fixtures, cricket schedules, Dipesh Sapkota, dipeshsapkota7.com.np"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(homepageJsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="site-shell min-h-screen has-hero">
    <HeroShowcase client:load matches={heroMatches} />

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-20 px-4 pb-24 pt-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:pt-32" aria-label="Fixtures by sport">
      <section id="football" class="scroll-mt-20">
        <MatchExplorer client:load category="football" matches={byCategory['football'] || []} exploreUrl="/football/" />
      </section>

      <section id="cricket" class="scroll-mt-20">
        <MatchExplorer client:load category="cricket" matches={byCategory['cricket'] || []} exploreUrl="/cricket/" />
      </section>

      <section id="basketball" class="scroll-mt-20">
        <MatchExplorer client:load category="basketball" matches={byCategory['basketball'] || []} exploreUrl="/basketball/" />
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="border-t border-line py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="eyebrow">What Sportivo does</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-fg sm:text-4xl">
            One place for fixtures, scores and streams, in NST
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-fg-2">
            Schedules from upstream sports feeds are converted to Nepal Standard Time, paired with live status and stream servers, and kept in sync while a match is on.
          </p>
        </div>

        <dl class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <div>
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-fg">
              <svg class="icon text-fg-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
              Nepal Standard Time
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-fg-2">Every kickoff is shown in UTC+5:45. No conversion on your side.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-fg">
              <svg class="icon text-fg-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m10 9 5 3-5 3z"/></svg>
              Several stream servers
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-fg-2">Each match lists the servers available for it, with HD where the provider offers it. If one drops, switch to the next.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-fg">
              <svg class="icon text-fg-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5L12 17.8 6.2 20.9l1.1-6.5L2.6 9.8l6.5-.9z"/></svg>
              Watchlist
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-fg-2">Star a match or a team and it stays in your watchlist, saved in this browser, no account.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-fg">
              <svg class="icon text-fg-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
              Live status and alerts
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-fg-2">See which games are on right now and get a notification when one you starred is about to start.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-line py-24" aria-labelledby="homepage-faq-heading">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
            <h2 id="homepage-faq-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-fg">
              Common questions
            </h2>
          </div>
          <dl class="divide-y divide-line lg:col-span-8">
            {faqs.map((faq) => (
              <div class="py-6 first:pt-0 last:pb-0">
                <dt class="text-base font-medium text-fg">{faq.question}</dt>
                <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-fg-2">{faq.answer}</dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
